{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595460/extras/gif_machine_soda.gif?t=1742498123\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tiny Vending Machine</strong> is an <strong>idle pixel art game</strong> designed to run at the bottom of your screen while you focus on other tasks. Your goal is to build and expand your vending machine empire, keeping them stocked and maximizing profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>How does it work?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Buy and manage</strong> vending machines that sell a variety of products, including drinks, candy, ice cream, fruits, fast food, salads, soups, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595460/extras/Change-Food-Gif.gif?t=1742498123\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random customers</strong> will appear to purchase items \u2013 make sure your machines stay stocked to avoid missing sales.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade your machines</strong> to increase storage capacity. At the highest level, they become <strong>fully automated</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595460/extras/Machine_upgrade.gif?t=1742498123\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your machines</strong> with different colors to make your vending empire unique.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play without interrupting your routine!</strong><br><strong>Tiny Vending Machine</strong> runs in the background, allowing you to manage your machines while working, studying, or simply relaxing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expand your business and become the ultimate vending machine tycoon!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595460?t=1742498123","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595460/60061b229c21a1d11794fb1b4da126b74cbda197/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742498123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595460/8d6fb4f88bb37c7801999739f87187edabec208b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742498123","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595460/8d6fb4f88bb37c7801999739f87187edabec208b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742498123","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595460/extras/gif_machine_soda.gif?t=1742498123\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tiny Vending Machine</strong> is an <strong>idle pixel art game</strong> designed to run at the bottom of your screen while you focus on other tasks. Your goal is to build and expand your vending machine empire, keeping them stocked and maximizing profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>How does it work?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Buy and manage</strong> vending machines that sell a variety of products, including drinks, candy, ice cream, fruits, fast food, salads, soups, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595460/extras/Change-Food-Gif.gif?t=1742498123\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random customers</strong> will appear to purchase items \u2013 make sure your machines stay stocked to avoid missing sales.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade your machines</strong> to increase storage capacity. At the highest level, they become <strong>fully automated</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595460/extras/Machine_upgrade.gif?t=1742498123\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your machines</strong> with different colors to make your vending empire unique.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play without interrupting your routine!</strong><br><strong>Tiny Vending Machine</strong> runs in the background, allowing you to manage your machines while working, studying, or simply relaxing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expand your business and become the ultimate vending machine tycoon!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Frozen Logic Studios","Flipflops Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595460/11bbe2f7e0bcd21bfa8411b1f590fa2f2bf1fdd0/header.jpg?t=1742498123","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 10.15 Catalina or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon or Intel 64bit</li></ul>"},"name":"Tiny Vending Machines","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul